{"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/pushwooshnotificationui"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]},{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/pushwooshnotificationui"]}],"kind":"symbol","sections":[],"topicSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshNotificationUI\/documentation\/PushwooshNotificationUI\/PushwooshStoriesViewController"],"title":"Stories UI"},{"title":"Payload model","identifiers":["doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshNotificationUI\/documentation\/PushwooshNotificationUI\/StoryPage"]},{"title":"Analytics","identifiers":["doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshNotificationUI\/documentation\/PushwooshNotificationUI\/PushwooshStoriesDelegate"]},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshNotificationUI\/documentation\/PushwooshNotificationUI\/PushwooshStoriesMediaPrefetcher"],"title":"Media pre-cache"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[[]]},"metadata":{"title":"PushwooshNotificationUI","symbolKind":"module","modules":[{"name":"PushwooshNotificationUI"}],"role":"collection","roleHeading":"Framework","externalID":"PushwooshNotificationUI"},"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","text":"Overview","anchor":"Overview","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"PushwooshNotificationUI provides "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshNotificationUI\/documentation\/PushwooshNotificationUI\/PushwooshStoriesViewController"},{"type":"text","text":" — a drop-in"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"UNNotificationContentExtension","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" view controller that renders an Instagram-style","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"stories experience: full-bleed images, top progress bars, auto-advance, tap-zone","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"navigation, per-frame title\/subtitle, and an optional deep-link button.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The module links only UIKit, UserNotifications, and UserNotificationsUI (plus"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"CryptoKit for a stable cache key), so it adds no Pushwoosh Core\/Framework weight","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"to your memory-constrained extension process."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"Usage","type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"Usage"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"In your Notification Content Extension:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","code":["import PushwooshNotificationUI","","class NotificationViewController: PushwooshStoriesViewController {}"],"type":"codeListing"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Then set these keys in the extension’s Info.plist:","type":"text"}]},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"UNNotificationExtensionCategory","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" = ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"PW_STORIES"},{"type":"text","text":" (must match "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"aps.category"},{"text":")","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"UNNotificationExtensionUserInteractionEnabled","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" = "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"YES"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"UNNotificationExtensionDefaultContentHidden"},{"type":"text","text":" = "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"YES"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"UNNotificationExtensionInitialContentSizeRatio"},{"type":"text","text":" = e.g. "},{"code":"1.5","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" (keep in sync with ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshNotificationUI\/documentation\/PushwooshNotificationUI\/PushwooshStoriesViewController\/storyAspectRatio"},{"text":")","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"NSExtensionPrincipalClass","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" = ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"$(PRODUCT_MODULE_NAME).NotificationViewController"},{"type":"text","text":" (code-only, no storyboard)"}]}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"level":2,"text":"Payload","anchor":"Payload","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The stories are described by a ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"pw_stories"},{"type":"text","text":" block, alongside an "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"aps.category"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"matching "},{"code":"UNNotificationExtensionCategory","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":". The parser accepts the block either at"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"the ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"payload root","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" (e.g. via the Pushwoosh API "},{"code":"ios_root_params","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":") or inside the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"custom-data container "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"u"},{"type":"text","text":" \/ "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"userdata"},{"type":"text","text":" (the Pushwoosh API "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"data"},{"type":"text","text":" field — delivered as"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"a dictionary or a JSON-encoded string). The root form on the device looks like this:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"json","type":"codeListing","code":["{","  \"aps\": { \"category\": \"PW_STORIES\" },","  \"pw_stories\": { \"pages\": [","    { \"image\": \"https:\/\/...\/1.jpg\", \"duration\": 5.0,","      \"link\": \"myapp:\/\/sale\", \"button_title\": \"Buy\",","      \"title\": \"Summer Sale\", \"subtitle\": \"Up to 70% off\" },","    { \"image\": \"https:\/\/...\/2.jpg\" }","  ]}","}"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Sent through the "},{"code":"data","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" API field instead (recommended, since it does not depend on"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"ios_root_params","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"), the same block arrives nested under ","type":"text"},{"code":"u","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" — while "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"aps.category"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"(and ","type":"text"},{"code":"mutable-content","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" for the pre-cache path) still go through ","type":"text"},{"code":"ios_root_params.aps","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":","},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"as there is no dedicated request field for them. The relevant createMessage fields:"}]},{"syntax":"json","type":"codeListing","code":["{","  \"ios_root_params\": { \"aps\": { \"category\": \"PW_STORIES\", \"mutable-content\": 1 } },","  \"data\": { \"pw_stories\": { \"pages\": [ { \"image\": \"https:\/\/...\/1.jpg\" } ] } }","}"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The parser tries the root first, then "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"u"},{"type":"text","text":" \/ "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"userdata"},{"type":"text","text":", so both delivery styles work"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and old pushes keep rendering.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Every field except "},{"code":"image","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is optional. ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"link"},{"type":"text","text":" (like "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"image"},{"type":"text","text":") must include a URL"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"scheme. A missing, empty, or malformed payload falls back to the default content"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"(the alert body) without crashing — override ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshNotificationUI\/documentation\/PushwooshNotificationUI\/PushwooshStoriesViewController\/showDefaultContent(for:)","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},{"anchor":"Analytics","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Analytics"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Set "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshNotificationUI\/documentation\/PushwooshNotificationUI\/PushwooshStoriesViewController\/storiesDelegate","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" to observe lifecycle and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"engagement and forward it to your analytics (the module itself sends nothing):"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["class NotificationViewController: PushwooshStoriesViewController, PushwooshStoriesDelegate {","    override func viewDidLoad() {","        super.viewDidLoad()","        storiesDelegate = self","    }","    func storiesViewController(_ c: PushwooshStoriesViewController, didTapActionFor page: StoryPage, at index: Int) {","        \/\/ forward the per-page click to your backend","    }","}"]},{"text":"Instant \/ offline first frame (App Group pre-cache)","type":"heading","anchor":"Instant--offline-first-frame-App-Group-pre-cache","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"To make the first frame appear instantly (and offline), pre-download the media in"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"a Notification ","type":"text"},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Service","type":"text"}]},{"text":" Extension into a shared App Group container that the","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Content Extension reads from:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Enable the ","type":"text"},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"App Groups"}]},{"type":"text","text":" capability (same id) on both the Service and Content"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"extensions, and override ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshNotificationUI\/documentation\/PushwooshNotificationUI\/PushwooshStoriesViewController\/appGroupIdentifier","type":"reference"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"From the Service Extension’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"didReceive(_:withContentHandler:)"},{"type":"text","text":", call"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshNotificationUI\/documentation\/PushwooshNotificationUI\/PushwooshStoriesMediaPrefetcher\/prefetch(userInfo:appGroupIdentifier:completion:)","isActive":true},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Send the push with ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"mutable-content: 1"},{"text":" so the Service Extension runs.","type":"text"}]}]}],"type":"orderedList"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Without this, the module still works — images download on display instead."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"abstract":[{"text":"A ready-made full-screen “stories” UI for an expanded push notification.","type":"text"}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshNotificationUI\/documentation\/PushwooshNotificationUI"},"references":{"doc://com.pushwoosh.PushwooshNotificationUI/documentation/PushwooshNotificationUI/PushwooshStoriesViewController/storyAspectRatio":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Aspect ratio (height ÷ width) of the stories area. Keep this in sync with the extension’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"UNNotificationExtensionInitialContentSizeRatio"},{"text":" so the notification doesn’t resize after the","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"image loads. Override in a subclass to change the story proportions.","type":"text"}],"fragments":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"storyAspectRatio"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:14CoreFoundation7CGFloatV","text":"CGFloat","kind":"t